<title>USA: Hamilton Bancorp Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Hamilton Bancorp Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p>Net interest income			$7,309	     $6,496</p>
<p>Provision for credit losses		 748		  500</p>
<p>Net income				    2,823		2,517</p>
<p>PER COMMON SHARE DATA:</p>
<p>Net income per common share		0.47		 0.46</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding   5,953		5,430</p>
<p>	    (Dollars In Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Hamilton Bancorp Inc said it completed its initial public offering on March 31, 1997. The offering raised $39 million.</p>
